        <summary>
          <para>Represents that the user interaction that is requesting a rectangle on screen is doing so via the original requestRectangleOnScreen(Rect) or requestRectangleOnScreen(Rect,boolean) APIs that do not define the source. RECTANGLE_ON_SCREEN_REQUEST_SOURCE_UNDEFINED should be reserved for backward compatibility and should only be provided from calls to the original API.</para>
